(24, 'REPORT-00021', 22, 3, 16, 0, 0, 2, 318, 59, 0, '2024-12-17', '2024-12-25', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, '11:00:00', '', '318', '59', '1. All sop found and kept in almirah.\r\n2. All revenue register is updated. \r\n3. Assurance were signed for all latest Revision Sop lesson learnt and Safety Alert.\r\n4. Station need cleaning at gate no 1 And 3 . H/Keeping sup has been asked to get it clean.\r\n5. essential Equipment were found ok.\r\n6. First aid box is maintained', '', 2, 1, NULL, 318, 2, '2024-12-12 17:00:58', '2024-12-12 17:00:58', 1),
(25, 'REPORT-00022', 22, 3, 18, 0, 0, 2, 318, 448, 0, '2024-12-17', '2024-12-25', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, '11:00:00', '', '318', '448', '1. Notice board was updated found ok\r\n2. Assurance were given by staff for new Sop, rev etc. found updated\r\n3. All revenue register maintained.\r\n4. First aid items are available in first aid kit.\r\n5. Checked the Essential equipment found ok.\r\n5. Station cleaning of gate no 2 required. immediately asked H/keeping Sup to get it clean immediately.\r\n6. All Sop are available and kept in proper place in almirah. ', '', 2, 1, NULL, 318, 2, '2024-12-17 12:20:27', '2024-12-17 12:20:27', 1),
(26, 'REPORT-00023', 22, 3, 17, 0, 0, 2, 318, 52, 0, '2024-12-17', '2024-12-25', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, '11:00:00', '', '318', '52', '1.SPN Book, Possession Register and Part b PTW checked found ok.\r\n2. All revenue register checked and found updated.\r\n3.All SOP normal station working and emergency Sop are available and kept in proper place.\r\n4. Station cleaning was satisfactory but found bird dropping at stairs and FOB. SC and H/Keeping Sup has been counselled for this and asked them to get it cleaned immediately. ', '', 2, 1, 1, 318, 2, '2024-12-17 12:20:27', '2024-12-17 12:20:27', 1),
(27, 'REPORT-00024', 23, 12, 0, 0, 0, 3, 199, 590, 14, '2024-12-18', '2024-12-19', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, '22:00:00', 'I have done night inspection on 14.12.2024 and observations are mentioned.', '199', '201,590', 'CEO sir and I was inspected the maintenance of Section insulator at A10 towards A11 station and OHE team is working well and following all safe guidelines. ', '', 2, 0, NULL, 199, 2, '2024-12-18 17:14:52', '2024-12-18 17:14:52', 1),
